        "original_id": "05eb1363-bc64-582f-869c-7f52f0d5e975",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Bears, Aliens of the Deep, African Cats, Frozen Planet, The Blue Planet, Planet Earth\n- People: Keith Scholey, Alastair Fothergill, Vanessa Berlowitz\n- Companies: Walden Media, Walt Disney Pictures, Disneynature\n- Places: Alaska\n\nFacts:\n- The Blue Planet is an award-winning series from 2001.\n- Planet Earth is an award-winning series from 2006.\n- Frozen Planet has a production team that includes executive producer Alastair Fothergill and series producer Vanessa Berlowitz.\n- The Frozen Planet production team was previously responsible for The Blue Planet and Planet Earth, and Frozen Planet is billed as a sequel of sorts.\n- Bears is a 2014 nature documentary film about a family of brown bears living in the coastal mountain ranges of Alaska.\n- Aliens of the Deep was produced by Walden Media and Walt Disney Pictures.\n- Keith Scholey co-directed African Cats and Bears with Alastair Fothergill for Disneynature.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
